# Copy to .env.local for local dev (optional - leave unset and the Vite
# dev proxy in vite.config.ts handles /api for you). In Vercel, set this
# as a Project Environment Variable to your deployed Render backend's
# origin, no trailing slash, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://ocr-data-entry-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
